# build outputs
# Anchored to the repo root - an unanchored "bin/" also matches nested
# directories like fleet-kit/fleet/bin/, which silently excluded the fleet's
# executables (run-digest, fleet-db, fleet-board) from being tracked.
/bin/
/dist/
*.out
*.log

